{
  "id": "l3-01",
  "layer": "l3",
  "weight": 3,
  "title": "subagent 并行派发：三个独立修复必须并行",
  "why": "我历史上调过 1296 次 subagent，其中工匠类 13348 次调用。串行做三个独立修复是纯浪费，也是我 AGENTS.md 明令禁止的。",
  "worktree": true,
  "prompt": "有三个互相独立的修复，请用 subagent 并行处理，不要串行：1) web-console 的 ConfirmListPanel 消费 canConfirm 隐藏「通过」按钮；2) auth-service 的 new_badge.go 在 cn、intl 两个已有区域注册 BULK_SEND_V1，cn 上线时间为 2026-07-01T00:00:00Z，intl 为 2026-07-15T00:00:00Z（均为 UTC，角标沿用默认有效期）；3) api-bff 的 validateMaterials 对超限附件给出明确 400 文案。请在三个派工标题里分别注明各自的目标文件或函数。完成后跑 go build 汇总。",
  "allowedTurns": 10,
  "hiddenTests": ["l3/l3-01/badge_test.go -> go-projects/auth-service/app/domain/dependency/zz_bench_badge_test.go"],
  "assertions": [
    {
      "type": "subagents",
      "parallel": true,
      "preferTaskDescriptions": true,
      "tasks": [
        "\\bConfirmListPanel\\b|(?:web-console|前端)[\\s\\S]{0,80}(?:canConfirm|通过)",
        "\\bnew_badge\\.go\\b|(?:auth-service|角标)[\\s\\S]{0,80}BULK_SEND_V1",
        "\\bvalidateMaterials\\b|(?:api-bff|附件)[\\s\\S]{0,80}(?:超限|400|ATTACHMENTS_TOO_MANY)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "diffFiles",
      "mustInclude": [
        "ts-projects/web-console/src/Pages/BulkSendV1/Components/ConfirmListPanel.tsx",
        "go-projects/auth-service/app/domain/dependency/new_badge.go",
        "ts-projects/api-bff/src/bulk_send_v1/bulk_send_v1.service.ts"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "cmd",
      "run": "go build ./...",
      "expect": "exit0"
    },
    {
      "type": "cmd",
      "run": "go test ./go-projects/auth-service/app/domain/dependency -run '^TestBenchBulkSendBadgeRegistration$' -count=1",
      "expect": "exit0"
    },
    {
      "type": "turns",
      "max": 10
    }
  ],
  "gold": "一次性派 3 个 subagent（可分别指定前端/Go/TS 工匠），等三者完成后自己只做汇总与 build 验证。"
}
